{"title": "Trigonometric Ratios (Level 3)", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>If tan&#952; = 21/20, then what is the value of (3cos&#952;  -  2sin&#952;)?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; tan&#952; = 21/20, &#2340;&#2379; (3cos&#952; - 2sin&#952;) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["12/29", "20/29", "18/29", "21/29"], "options_hi": ["12/29", "20/29", "18/29", "21/29"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>tan&#952; = 21/20</p><p>Perpendicular = 21, Base = 20</p><p>Hypotenuse = &radic;(21<sup>2</sup> + 20<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= &radic;(441 + 400)</p><p>= 29</p><p>Now,</p><p>3cos&#952;  -  2sin&#952; = 3*20/29  -  2*21/29</p><p>= 18/29</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>tan&#952; = 21/20</p><p>Perpendicular = 21, Base = 20</p><p>Hypotenuse = &radic;(21<sup>2</sup> + 20<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= &radic;(441 + 400)</p><p>= 29</p><p>Now,</p><p>3cos&#952;  -  2sin&#952; = 3*20/29  -  2*21/29</p><p>= 18/29</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If sin&#952; = 55/73, then what is the value of (3sec&#952;  -  5cot&#952;)?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sin&#952; = 55/73, &#2340;&#2379; (3sec&#952; - 5cot&#952;) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["22/129", "35/176", "23/129", "45/176"], "options_hi": ["22/129", "35/176", "23/129", "45/176"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>sin&#952; = 55/73</p><p>Perpendicular = 55, Hypotenuse = 73</p><p>Base = &radic;(73<sup>2</sup>  -  55<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= &radic;(128*18)</p><p>= 48</p><p>sec&#952; = 73/48</p><p>cot&#952; = 48/55</p><p>3sec&#952;  -  5cot&#952; = 3*73/48  -  5*48/55</p><p>= 73/16  -  48/11</p><p>= 35/176</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>sin&#952; = 55/73</p><p>Perpendicular = 55, Hypotenuse = 73</p><p>Base = &radic;(73<sup>2</sup>  -  55<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= &radic;(128*18)</p><p>= 48</p><p>sec&#952; = 73/48</p><p>cot&#952; = 48/55</p><p>3sec&#952;  -  5cot&#952; = 3*73/48  -  5*48/55</p><p>= 73/16  -  48/11</p><p>= 35/176</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If cos7A = sin(A  -  46&deg;), where A is an acute angle, then what is the measure of &#8736;A?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cos7A = sin(A - 46&deg;), &#2332;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; A &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#8736;A &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2346; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["16&deg;", "24&deg;", "17&deg;", "21&deg;"], "options_hi": ["16&deg;", "24&deg;", "17&deg;", "21&deg;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Since, cos&#952; = sin(90&deg;  -  &#952;)</p><p>cos7A = sin(A  -  46&deg;)</p><p>sin(90&deg; - 7A) = sin(A  -  46&deg;)</p><p>90&deg; - 7A = A - 46&deg;</p><p>A = 17&deg;</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Since, cos&#952; = sin(90&deg;  -  &#952;)</p><p>cos7A = sin(A  -  46&deg;)</p><p>sin(90&deg; - 7A) = sin(A  -  46&deg;)</p><p>90&deg; - 7A = A - 46&deg;</p><p>A = 17&deg;</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If cosY = 8/17, then the value of sinY*secY*tanY is ________.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cosY = 8/17, &#2340;&#2379; sinY*secY*tanY &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; ________ &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["225/64", "15/8", "1", "225/136"], "options_hi": ["225/64", "15/8", "1", "225/136"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>cosY = 8/17</p><p>Base = 8, Hypotenuse = 17</p><p>Perpendicular = &radic;(17<sup>2</sup>  -  8<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= &radic;(25*9)</p><p>= 15</p><p>=&gt; sinY*secY*tanY</p><p>= 15/17 * 17/8 * 15/8</p><p>= 225/64</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>cosY = 8/17</p><p>Base = 8, Hypotenuse = 17</p><p>Perpendicular = &radic;(17<sup>2</sup>  -  8<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= &radic;(25*9)</p><p>= 15</p><p>=&gt; sinY*secY*tanY</p><p>= 15/17 * 17/8 * 15/8</p><p>= 225/64</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If tan&#952; = 11/60, then the value of 2tanY*3cosecY  -  4secY is ________.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; tan&#952; = 11/60, &#2340;&#2379; 2tanY*3cosecY - 4secY &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; ________ &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["61/60", "150/61", "121/30", "61/30"], "options_hi": ["61/60", "150/61", "121/30", "61/30"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>tan&#952; = 11/60</p><p>Perpendicular = 11, Base = 60</p><p>Hypotenuse = &radic;(11<sup>2</sup> + 60<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= &radic;(121 + 3600)</p><p>= 61</p><p>=&gt; 2tanY*3cosecY  -  4secY</p><p>= 6 * 11/60 * 61/11  -  4* 61/60</p><p>= 61/10  -  61/15</p><p>= 61/30</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>tan&#952; = 11/60</p><p>Perpendicular = 11, Base = 60</p><p>Hypotenuse = &radic;(11<sup>2</sup> + 60<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= &radic;(121 + 3600)</p><p>= 61</p><p>=&gt; 2tanY*3cosecY  -  4secY</p><p>= 6 * 11/60 * 61/11  -  4* 61/60</p><p>= 61/10  -  61/15</p><p>= 61/30</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If (sec&#945; + tan&#945;)/(sec&#945; - tan&#945;) = 37/7, then what is the value of sin&#945;?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (sec&#945; + tan&#945;)/(sec&#945; - tan&#945;) = 37/7, &#2340;&#2379; sin&#945; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["22/19", "30/23", "15/22", "29/34"], "options_hi": ["22/19", "30/23", "15/22", "29/34"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>(sec&#945; + tan&#945;)/(sec&#945; - tan&#945;) = 37/7</p><p>7sec&#945; + 7tan&#945; = 37sec&#945;  -  37tan&#945;</p><p>sec&#945;/tan&#945; = 22/15</p><p>(1/cos&#945;)/(sin&#945;/cos&#945;) = 22/15</p><p>sin&#945; = 15/22</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(sec&#945; + tan&#945;)/(sec&#945; - tan&#945;) = 37/7</p><p>7sec&#945; + 7tan&#945; = 37sec&#945;  -  37tan&#945;</p><p>sec&#945;/tan&#945; = 22/15</p><p>(1/cos&#945;)/(sin&#945;/cos&#945;) = 22/15</p><p>sin&#945; = 15/22</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify (cos21&deg; + sin21&deg;)/(cos21&deg; - sin21&deg;).</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2352;&#2354; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2319;&#2306; (cos21&deg; + syn21&deg;)/(cos21&deg; - syn21&deg;).</p>", "options_en": ["cot28&deg;", "tan66&deg;", "tan24&deg;", "cot64&deg;"], "options_hi": ["cot28&deg;", "tan66&deg;", "tan24&deg;", "cot64&deg;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>(cos21&deg; + sin21&deg;)/(cos21&deg; - sin21&deg;)</p><p>= (1 + sin21&deg;/cos21&deg;)/(1  -  sin21&deg;/cos21&deg;)</p><p>= (1 + tan21&deg;)/(1 - tan21&deg;)</p><p>= (tan&#960;/4 + tan21&deg;)/(1 - tan&#960;/4 * tan21&deg;)</p><p>Since, tan (A + B) = (tanA + tanB)/(1  -  tanAtanB)</p><p>= tan(45 + 21&deg;)</p><p>= tan66&deg;</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(cos21&deg; + sin21&deg;)/(cos21&deg; - sin21&deg;)</p><p>= (1 + sin21&deg;/cos21&deg;)/(1  -  sin21&deg;/cos21&deg;)</p><p>= (1 + tan21&deg;)/(1 - tan21&deg;)</p><p>= (tan&#960;/4 + tan21&deg;)/(1 - tan&#960;/4 * tan21&deg;)</p><p>Since, tan (A + B) = (tanA + tanB)/(1  -  tanAtanB)</p><p>= tan(45 + 21&deg;)</p><p>= tan66&deg;</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If sin(A + 2B) = 1/&radic;2 and cos(A  -  B) = 1, then find the value of &#8736;B.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sin(A + 2B) = 1/&radic;2 &#2324;&#2352; cos(A - B) = 1, &#2340;&#2379; &#8736;B &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["15&deg;", "30&deg;", "10&deg;", "45&deg;"], "options_hi": ["15&deg;", "30&deg;", "10&deg;", "45&deg;"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>sin(A + 2B) = 1/&radic;2</p><p>sin(A + 2B) = sin45&deg;</p><p>A + 2B = 45&deg; ------(1)</p><p>cos(A  -  B) = 1</p><p>cos(A  -  B) = cos0&deg;</p><p>A  -  B = 0&deg; ------(2)</p><p>From eqn (1) and (2)  - </p><p>B = 15&deg;</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>sin(A + 2B) = 1/&radic;2</p><p>sin(A + 2B) = sin45&deg;</p><p>A + 2B = 45&deg; ------(1)</p><p>cos(A  -  B) = 1</p><p>cos(A  -  B) = cos0&deg;</p><p>A  -  B = 0&deg; ------(2)</p><p>From eqn (1) and (2)  - </p><p>B = 15&deg;</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If tan(A  -  B) = 1/&radic;3 and sec(A + B) = 2, then find the value of (2A  -  B).</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; tan(A - B) = 1/&radic;3 &#2324;&#2352; sec(A + B) = 2, &#2340;&#2379; (2A - B) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["45&deg;", "60&deg;", "90&deg;", "75&deg;"], "options_hi": ["45&deg;", "60&deg;", "90&deg;", "75&deg;"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>tan(A - B) = 1/&radic;3</p><p>tan(A - B) = tan30&deg;</p><p>A  -  B = 30&deg; ------(1)</p><p>sec(A + B) = 2</p><p>sec(A + B) = sec60&deg;</p><p>A + B = 60&deg; ------(2)</p><p>From eqn (1) and (2)  - </p><p>A = 45&deg;, B = 15&deg;</p><p>2A  -  B = 2*45  -  15 = 75&deg;</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>tan(A - B) = 1/&radic;3</p><p>tan(A - B) = tan30&deg;</p><p>A  -  B = 30&deg; ------(1)</p><p>sec(A + B) = 2</p><p>sec(A + B) = sec60&deg;</p><p>A + B = 60&deg; ------(2)</p><p>From eqn (1) and (2)  - </p><p>A = 45&deg;, B = 15&deg;</p><p>2A  -  B = 2*45  -  15 = 75&deg;</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If sin{3(x - y)} = cos(x - y), then what is the value of tan{2(x  -  y)}?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sin{3(x - y)} = cos(x - y) &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; tan{2(x - y)} &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["1", "&radic;3", "1/&radic;3", "0"], "options_hi": ["1", "&radic;3", "1/&radic;3", "0"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>sin{3(x - y)} = cos(x - y)</p><p>cos{90 - 3(x - y)} = cos(x - y)</p><p>90  -  3(x  -  y) = x  -  y</p><p>2(x  -  y) = 45&deg;</p><p>tan{2(x  -  y)} = tan45&deg; = 1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>sin{3(x - y)} = cos(x - y)</p><p>cos{90 - 3(x - y)} = cos(x - y)</p><p>90  -  3(x  -  y) = x  -  y</p><p>2(x  -  y) = 45&deg;</p><p>tan{2(x  -  y)} = tan45&deg; = 1</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If A + B = 45&deg; and (1 - tanA)(1 - tanB) = 3x, then find the value of x.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A + B = 45&deg; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; (1 - tanA)(1 - tanB) = 3x, &#2340;&#2379; x &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["2", "-1", "0", "1"], "options_hi": ["2", "-1", "0", "1"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>A + B = 45&deg;</p><p>Put A = 45&deg; and B = 0&deg;</p><p>(1 - tanA)(1 - tanB) = 3x</p><p>(1  -  tan45&deg;)(1  -  tan0&deg;) = 3x</p><p>(1  -  1)(1  -  0) = 3x</p><p>3x = 0</p><p>x = 0</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>A + B = 45&deg;</p><p>Put A = 45&deg; and B = 0&deg;</p><p>(1 - tanA)(1 - tanB) = 3x</p><p>(1  -  tan45&deg;)(1  -  tan0&deg;) = 3x</p><p>(1  -  1)(1  -  0) = 3x</p><p>3x = 0</p><p>x = 0</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><img width=553 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image001.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p><img width=553 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image001.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["sin(C  -  A)/cosAcosC", "cos(C + A)/cosAcosC", "cos(C  -  A)/cosAcosC", "sin(A  -  C)/cosAcosC"], "options_hi": ["sin(C  -  A)/cosAcosC", "cos(C + A)/cosAcosC", "cos(C  -  A)/cosAcosC", "sin(A  -  C)/cosAcosC"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>cos(X + Y) = cosXcosY  -  sinXsinY</p><p><img width=157 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=315 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image003.png\"></p><p><img width=197 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image004.png\"></p><p><img width=101 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image005.png\"></p><p><img width=153 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image006.png\"></p><p><img width=84 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image007.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>cos(X + Y) = cosXcosY  -  sinXsinY</p><p><img width=157 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=315 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image003.png\"></p><p><img width=197 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image004.png\"></p><p><img width=101 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image005.png\"></p><p><img width=153 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image006.png\"></p><p><img width=84 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image007.png\"></p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If tan&#952; = 7 + 4&radic;3, then find the value of cosec&#952;sec&#952;.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; tan&#952; = 7 + 4&radic;3, &#2340;&#2379; cosec&#952;sec&#952; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["21", "14", "48", "41"], "options_hi": ["21", "14", "48", "41"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>tan&#952; = 7 + 4&radic;3</p><p>cot&#952; = 1/(7 + 4&radic;3)</p><p>cot&#952; = (7 - 4&radic;3)/[7<sup>2</sup>  -  (4&radic;3)<sup>2</sup>] = 7 - 4&radic;3</p><p>Now,</p><p>tan&#952; + cot&#952; = (7 + 4&radic;3) + (7 - 4&radic;3) = 14</p><p>sin&#952;/cos&#952; + cos&#952;/sin&#952; = 14</p><p>1/sin&#952;cos&#952; = 14</p><p>cosec&#952;sec&#952; = 14</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>tan&#952; = 7 + 4&radic;3</p><p>cot&#952; = 1/(7 + 4&radic;3)</p><p>cot&#952; = (7 - 4&radic;3)/[7<sup>2</sup>  -  (4&radic;3)<sup>2</sup>] = 7 - 4&radic;3</p><p>Now,</p><p>tan&#952; + cot&#952; = (7 + 4&radic;3) + (7 - 4&radic;3) = 14</p><p>sin&#952;/cos&#952; + cos&#952;/sin&#952; = 14</p><p>1/sin&#952;cos&#952; = 14</p><p>cosec&#952;sec&#952; = 14</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Triangle PQR is a right  -  angled triangle at Q. If cotP = 9/40, then cosP  -  cosQ + cosR will be equal to -</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; PQR, Q &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2350;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cotP = 9/40, &#2340;&#2379; cosP - cosQ + cosR &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366; -</p>", "options_en": ["1(7/41)", "1(3/41)", "1(6/41)", "1(8/41)"], "options_hi": ["1(7/41)", "1(3/41)", "1(6/41)", "1(8/41)"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p><img width=169 height=146 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image008.png\"></p><p>Triangle PQR is a right  -  angled triangle at Q, i.e.</p><p>PR = hypotenuse</p><p>cotP = B/P = 9/40</p><p>P = 9, B = 40</p><p>PR = Hypotenuse = &radic;(9<sup>2</sup> + 40<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= 41</p><p>cosP  -  cosQ + cosR</p><p>= cosP  -  cos90&deg; + cosR</p><p>= 9/41  -  0 + 40/41</p><p>= 49/41</p><p>= 1(8/41)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=169 height=146 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image008.png\"></p><p>Triangle PQR is a right  -  angled triangle at Q, i.e.</p><p>PR = hypotenuse</p><p>cotP = B/P = 9/40</p><p>P = 9, B = 40</p><p>PR = Hypotenuse = &radic;(9<sup>2</sup> + 40<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>= 41</p><p>cosP  -  cosQ + cosR</p><p>= cosP  -  cos90&deg; + cosR</p><p>= 9/41  -  0 + 40/41</p><p>= 49/41</p><p>= 1(8/41)</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><img width=463 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image009.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p><img width=463 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image009.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["2", "-1", "0", "-3"], "options_hi": ["2", "-1", "0", "-3"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p><img width=341 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image010.png\"></p><p><img width=495 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=277 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image012.png\"></p><p><img width=89 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image013.png\"></p><p>= -3</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=341 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image010.png\"></p><p><img width=495 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=277 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image012.png\"></p><p><img width=89 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image013.png\"></p><p>= -3</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><img width=400 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image014.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p><img width=400 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image014.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["5", "7", "6", "4"], "options_hi": ["5", "7", "6", "4"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>cot&#946; = 11</p><p><img width=161 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image015.png\"></p><p><img width=167 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image016.png\"></p><p><img width=153 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image017.png\"></p><p><img width=77 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image018.png\"></p><p>= 6</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>cot&#946; = 11</p><p><img width=161 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image015.png\"></p><p><img width=167 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image016.png\"></p><p><img width=153 height=40 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image017.png\"></p><p><img width=77 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image018.png\"></p><p>= 6</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>In a right  -  angled triangle ABC, &#8736;B = 90&deg; and &#8736;A and &#8736;C are acute angles. If secC = 3, then find the value of tanAcotC + cotAtanC.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; ABC &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#8736;B = 90&deg; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#8736;A &#2324;&#2352; &#8736;C &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; secC = 3 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; tanAcotC + cotAtanC &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["65/8", "1/4", "16", "73/72"], "options_hi": ["65/8", "1/4", "16", "73/72"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=231 height=184 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image023.png\"></p><p>secC = 3</p><p>H/B = 3/1</p><p>P = &radic;(3<sup>2</sup>  -  1<sup>2</sup>) = 2&radic;2</p><p>tanAcotC + cotAtanC</p><p>= (1/2&radic;2) * (1/2&radic;2) + (2&radic;2/1) * (2&radic;2/1)</p><p>= 1/8 + 8</p><p>= 65/8</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=231 height=184 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image023.png\"></p><p>secC = 3</p><p>H/B = 3/1</p><p>P = &radic;(3<sup>2</sup>  -  1<sup>2</sup>) = 2&radic;2</p><p>tanAcotC + cotAtanC</p><p>= (1/2&radic;2) * (1/2&radic;2) + (2&radic;2/1) * (2&radic;2/1)</p><p>= 1/8 + 8</p><p>= 65/8</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>In a right  -  angled triangle XYZ, &#8736;Y = 90&deg; and &#8736;X and &#8736;Z are acute angles. If cosecX = 5&radic;2, then find the value of sinZcosY + cosXsinY.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2349;&#2369;&#2332; XYZ &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#8736;Y = 90&deg; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#8736;X &#2324;&#2352; &#8736;Z &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cosecX = 5&radic;2 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; sinZcosY + cosXsinY &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["7&radic;2/10", "5&radic;2/7", "49/10", "4&radic;2/5"], "options_hi": ["7&radic;2/10", "5&radic;2/7", "49/10", "4&radic;2/5"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=281 height=225 id=\"Picture 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image024.png\"></p><p>cosecX = 5&radic;2</p><p>H/P = 5&radic;2/1</p><p>B = &radic;[(5&radic;2)<sup>2</sup>  -  1<sup>2</sup>] = 7</p><p>sinZcosY + cosXsinY</p><p>= (7/5&radic;2) * cos90&deg; + (7/5&radic;2) * sin90&deg;</p><p>= 0 + (7/5&radic;2)</p><p>= 7&radic;2/10</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=281 height=225 id=\"Picture 1\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26460/image024.png\"></p><p>cosecX = 5&radic;2</p><p>H/P = 5&radic;2/1</p><p>B = &radic;[(5&radic;2)<sup>2</sup>  -  1<sup>2</sup>] = 7</p><p>sinZcosY + cosXsinY</p><p>= (7/5&radic;2) * cos90&deg; + (7/5&radic;2) * sin90&deg;</p><p>= 0 + (7/5&radic;2)</p><p>= 7&radic;2/10</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>If x = sin<sup>14</sup> y + cos<sup>14</sup> y, then for all values of y </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = sin<sup>14</sup> y + cos<sup>14</sup> y &#2361;&#2376; , &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; y &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376; -</p>", "options_en": ["0 &lt; x &lt; 1", "0 &lt; x &lt;= 1", "0 &lt;= x &lt; 1", "0 &lt;= x &lt;= 1"], "options_hi": ["0 &lt; x &lt; 1", "0 &lt; x &lt;= 1", "0 &lt;= x &lt; 1", "0 &lt;= x &lt;= 1"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>x = sin<sup>14</sup> y + cos<sup>14</sup> y</p><p>Even power means no negative value and max value will be 1 and never be zero</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>x = sin<sup>14</sup> y + cos<sup>14</sup> y</p><p>Even power means no negative value and max value will be 1 and never be zero</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The value of sin435&deg;cos405&deg;+cos(-285&deg;)sin(-315&deg;) is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>sin435&deg;cos405&deg;+cos(-285&deg;)sin(-315&deg;) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["1", "1/2", "0", "(&radic;3/2)"], "options_hi": ["1", "1/2", "0", "(&radic;3/2)"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>sin435&deg;cos405&deg;+cos(-285&deg;)sin(-315&deg;)</p><p>= sin(360 + 75)cos(360 + 45) + cos(-360 + 75)sin(-360 + 45)</p><p>= sin75 cos45 + cos(360  -  75) {-(sin360 - 45)}</p><p>= sin75 cos45 + cos75 sin45</p><p>= sin(75 + 45)</p><p>= sin120</p><p>= sin (90 + 30) = cos30 = (&radic;3/2)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>sin435&deg;cos405&deg;+cos(-285&deg;)sin(-315&deg;)</p><p>= sin(360 + 75)cos(360 + 45) + cos(-360 + 75)sin(-360 + 45)</p><p>= sin75 cos45 + cos(360  -  75) {-(sin360 - 45)}</p><p>= sin75 cos45 + cos75 sin45</p><p>= sin(75 + 45)</p><p>= sin120</p><p>= sin (90 + 30) = cos30 = (&radic;3/2)</p>"}]}